          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yozefu odwoko ni, “Arango wutmin an. Mondo waci ran kama jokway'iye mwendi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jalo owaco rigo ni, “Jotieko kadho woko. Kole awinjo ka jowaco ni, ‘Weyi wakadhi i Dothan.’ ” Ameno Yozefu oluwo wutmin to nwaŋo jo i Dothan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wutmin joneno go gi bor, aka mafodi k'otundo cegin gi jo joyere neko go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jowaco wegi gi wegi ni, “Jalek ee bino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biye win, weyi waneki go aka wabol i bur acel; to wawaco ni ogwaŋ madudi ocamo go, aka nyaka walaneno gima lek pere olokere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
